DESCRIPTION: \nVisiting the Pantry:\n1) Please have your Event Pass\, CWID
  and have a PantrySoft Registration. 2) Please bring your own shopping ba
 g and ID card!***Visitors are allowed to come once/week***\nOur Mission: 
