  Red Hawk Pantry is open to all students\, staff\, and faculty at no cost
 . If you are unable to visit during our regular hours\, please reach out 
 via email at redhawkpantry@montclair.edu\nStay updated by following us on
  Instagram: @montclair_redhawkpantry\n🍎 Fall 2026 Hours\n\nTuesdays: 1:3
 0-3:30pm\nThursdays: 5-7pm\nSaturdays: 11-1pm\n\n \n\nHosted by: Red Hawk
  Pantry\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.camp
 uslabs.com/engage/event/12618430
