DESCRIPTION:Have you ever seen a TikTok about a new diet\, food\, or recip
 e that someone claimed "fixed all their problems?" You're not the only on
 e! Non-nutrition professionals in media love to talk about nutrition like
  they're experts\, but do you know how to identify the professionals from
  the influencers? Come to this MSDO meeting to explore current nutrition 
 trends circulating the media\, learn how to critically analyze informatio
 n you view\, and maybe even engage in some interesting conversations abou
 t your own nutrition beliefs. This space is welcome to all\, and this inc
 ludes different belief systems around food. This will not be a space to s
 hame\, guilt\, or tell you if what you're eating is right or wrong. We en
 courage everyone to come with an open-mind and the curiosity to know more
 ! \n\nHosted by: Dietetics Organization\n\nOnline Location: https://montc
 lair.zoom.us/j/91867896766\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12777297
