DESCRIPTION:Topic: Puzzles of Perception\nPhilosophy for Lunch is a weekly
  event at which students\, professors\, and other philosophy enthusiasts 
 close-read and discuss a few great passages of philosophy. The themes are
  different each week. No preparation or previous knowledge of philosophy 
 is needed. Everyone is welcome! Bring a beverage\, and if you’re hungry\,
  bring your actual lunch (there will be pizza).\n\nHosted by: College of 
 Humanities and Social Sciences (CHSS)\n\nAdditional Information can be fo
 und at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12783228
