DESCRIPTION:Join Advocacy and Outreach for our 3rd Annual LGBTQ+ and Disab
 ility History and Awareness Month Flag Raising and Reception — a joyful c
 elebration of identity\, resilience\, and community!\nPride and Progress 
 brings together students\, faculty\, and staff to honor the rich historie
 s and vibrant futures of LGBTQ+ and disability communities. Enjoy an insp
 iring flag-raising ceremony featuring an energetic MC\, powerful speakers
 \, and a special live performance you won’t want to miss.\nThis year's th
 eme is "The World Works Better With Us: Celebrating the valuable contribu
 tions of queer and disabled folks in professional and learning spaces whi
 le collectively advocating for continued respect\, inclusion\, and empowe
 rment".\nCome as you are\, bring your friends\, and help us raise our voi
 ces (and our flags!) in honor of progress\, pride\, and community power.\
 nThis event is hosted by Advocacy & Outreach in collaboration with the Of
 fice of Community Resilience and Officer Wellness\, GSWS\, Student Health
  Center\, Inclusive Excellence\, Disability Resource Center\, Health Prom
 otion\, CAPS\, Garden State Equality\, Queer Employee Network\, and Disab
 ility Caucus.\n\nHosted by: Advocacy and Outreach\n\nAdditional Informati
 on can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1250221
 5
DTEND:20261001T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045349Z
DTSTART:20261001T160000Z
LOCATION:STCT Ballrooms A & B
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pride and Progress: Celebrating LGBTQ+ and Disability Journeys
