 g where students can come together\, relax\, get some homework done\, gra
 b snacks\, and spend time with friends. There’s no formal agenda and no p
 ressure to participate. Whether you want a quiet place to study\, take a 
 break between classes\, play a game\, chat with other students\, or just 
 hang out\, you’re welcome to drop by.\nCome for five minutes or stay for 
 the whole time. Bring your homework\, grab a snack\, and make yourself co
 mfortable.\n\nHosted by: Hillel\n\nAdditional Information can be found at
 : https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12749967
