DESCRIPTION:Join the Residence Life Team on Thursday\, October 1\, 2026\, 
 at 7:00 PM for Community Floor Meetings! \nConnect with one another\, the
  Residence Life staff\, and receive important information that supports a
  safe and successful living environment. Students can expect a brief over
 view of key community policies\, upcoming building updates\, and opportun
 ities to get involved throughout the semester. Staff will highlight expec
 tations for shared spaces\, review essential safety procedures\, and answ
 er any questions residents may have. By attending\, students will gain cl
 arity on community standards\, learn about available resources\, and unde
 rstand how to contribute positively to the residential experience.\n\nHos
 ted by: Bloomfield's Office of Residence Life\n\nAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12809398
