DESCRIPTION:Start your day with coffee and conversation! Join the Office o
 f Student Belonging and Civic and Voter Engagement for Espresso Your Vote
 \, a welcoming pop-up event designed to help you prepare for the upcoming
  election.\nWhether you need to register to vote\, update your voter regi
 stration\, check your registration status\, or simply have questions abou
 t the voting process\, our team is here to help. We'll provide trusted\, 
 nonpartisan information to ensure you have everything you need to vote wi
 th confidence.\nEnjoy a complimentary cup of coffee while connecting with
  fellow students\, learning about important election dates and deadlines\
 , and discovering the many ways you can make your voice heard.\nStop by t
 o:\n\nRegister to vote or update your voter registration\nVerify your vot
 er registration status\nLearn about your voting options\nAsk questions ab
 out the upcoming election\nGrab a cup of coffee and connect with campus r
 esources\n\nSometimes the best conversations happen over coffee. Take a b
 reak\, enjoy a fresh cup\, and leave feeling informed\, prepared\, and re
 ady to participate in our democracy.\n\nHosted by: Civic & Voter Engageme
 nt\, Office of Student Belonging\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12540067
DTEND:20261005T193000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045349Z
DTSTART:20261005T173000Z
LOCATION:Student Center Ballroom B
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY: Espresso Your Vote Grab a Coffee. Get Election Ready. (Montclair 
 Campus)
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12540067
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12540067
X-HOSTS:Office of Student Belonging
