DESCRIPTION:Greek Council Meetings are held bi-weekly on Mondays from 2:00
  PM to 3:30 PM and bring together recognized Greek organizations and fell
 owships to discuss important updates\, upcoming events\, initiatives\, re
 sponsibilities\, and matters impacting the Greek community.\nThese meetin
 gs are exclusively for members and representatives of recognized Greek or
 ganizations and fellowships. They are not open to the general student bod
 y or non-Greek attendees.\nOrganizations and fellowships are encouraged t
 o have representation at each meeting to stay informed and engaged with G
 reek Council.\n\nHosted by: Bloomfield Greek Council\n\nAdditional Inform
 ation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1269
 6580
