DESCRIPTION:Shalom Red Hawks\,\nHelp Hillel take down our campus sukkah af
 ter a week of celebrating Sukkot! Come lend a hand\, help us pack everyth
 ing away\, and make the process quick and easy with friends from the Hill
 el community. Whether you helped build it or are just stopping by to help
  out\, every hand makes a difference!\nHow do I sign up?● FREE for all MS
 U students and MSU Hillel members● RSVP on this Engage page\nWhen?● Date:
  Monday\, October 5th\, 2026● Time: 2pm-4pm\nThings to bring?● Your Stude
 nt ID● Comfortable clothes for helping with the takedown\nWho are we?Shal
 om! Montclair Hillel is a Jewish student organization on campus that work
 s on creating a safe and supportive community for our students.\n\nHosted
  by: Hillel\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.
 campuslabs.com/engage/event/12773720
