DESCRIPTION:A strong letter of recommendation starts long before you ask! 
 Join us for an engaging virtual workshop on how to build meaningful relat
 ionships with professors and supervisors. Learn how to confidently reques
 t letters of recommendation. We'll discuss who to ask\, when to ask\, how
  to make the request\, what materials to provide\, and common mistakes to
  avoid. Students will also learn strategies for staying connected with po
 tential recommenders and preparing for future professional school applica
 tions. \nThis workshop is one of the required PMP programs that can be co
 mpleted toward eligibility for the HFNJ BLS Scholars Certification Progra
 m. \nPlease Note: This is a recorded virtual event. By registering for an
 d participating in this event\, you acknowledge and agree that you may be
  recorded and/or filmed during the session.\n\nHosted by: Pre-Medical Pro
 gram\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campusl
 abs.com/engage/event/12764128
