DESCRIPTION:Withum is a prominent top-25 national advisory\, tax\, and acc
 ounting firm headquartered in Princeton\, New Jersey. Founded in 1974\, t
 he firm has grown to include over 2\,400 team members globally and genera
 tes more than $500 million in annual revenue. They provide comprehensive 
 services ranging from traditional audit and assurance to modern digital t
 ransformation\, cybersecurity\, and management consulting. Withum serves 
 a diverse client base across major sectors\, including technology\, healt
 hcare\, financial services\, and real estate. As an independent member of
  the HLB International network\, the firm combines deep local expertise w
 ith a powerful global reach. Led by CEO Pat Walsh\, the company is widely
  recognized for its innovative digital solutions and highly supportive wo
 rkplace culture.\n\nHosted by: Accounting Society\n\nAdditional Informati
 on can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1280736
