DESCRIPTION:Relationships can be exciting\, complicated\, and sometimes ha
 rd to navigate\, but you don’t have to do it alone. Join us to learn how 
 to recognize red and green flags in relationships and build stronger boun
 daries. We’ll discuss dating trends\, common dating misconceptions\, and 
 ways to build healthier relationships while connecting you with resources
  and support available both on and off campus. Leave with a better sense 
 of what you want and deserve in a relationship\, along with the tools to 
 help you get there. All are welcome! \nOctober 7th \nMachuga Heights\n7PM
 -9PM\n\nHosted by: Residence Life\n\nAdditional Information can be found 
