DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night in New York City on October 8th to see Chi
 cago on Broadway. We’ll head to New York City for a live performance of C
 hicago on Broadway. The show brings music\, dance\, and storytelling toge
 ther in one of the most iconic theater productions on stage. Chicago is a
  long-running Broadway musical set in a world of crime\, fame\, and perfo
 rmance. The cast delivers high-energy numbers and sharp choreography thro
 ughout the show. Bring comfortable shoes\, a good attitude\, and get read
 y for a night in the city.\nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegister online through 
 Fusion\, in the Student Recreation Center's main office\, or over the pho
 ne (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students: $45\n\nWhere and when?\n\nThursday
 \, October 8\, 2026\nArrive before 5 PM pickup\; show starts at 7 PM\nMee
 t at Student Recreation Center\nEvent held at: Ambassador Theatre\, 219 W
 est 49th Street\, New York\, NY\, 10019 \n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreatio
 n\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs
 .com/engage/event/12656712
