DESCRIPTION:The Charity Masquerade Ball is an elegant evening dedicated to
  bringing the campus community together in support of a meaningful cause.
  Hosted by the Bangladesh Student Association (BSA) in collaboration with
  participating student organizations\, this formal event features dinner\
 , music\, entertainment\, dancing\, and a masquerade-themed atmosphere th
 at encourages students to connect and celebrate in an inclusive setting. 
 Proceeds from the event will benefit a designated charitable organization
 \, allowing attendees to enjoy a memorable evening while giving back to t
 he community. Through collaboration and philanthropy\, this event aims to
  foster unity\, cultural appreciation\, and service across Montclair Stat
 e University. Everyone is welcome.\n\nHosted by: Bangladesh Student Assoc
 iation \, Latin American Student Organization\, Multicultural Psychology 
 Scholars\, Montclair Unified Filipino American Student Association\, Mexi
 can-American Student Association\, North African Society\, Office of Stud
 ent Belonging\, Pakistani Student Organization\, Peruvian-American Studen
 t Organization\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montcla
 ir.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12778255
