DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a spooky night full of thrills\, screams\, and H
 alloween fun at Brighton Asylum! Join us on Friday\, October 9\, 2026\, f
 rom 8-10:30 pm for an unforgettable night featuring their iconic haunted 
 house attraction! Entry to the haunted house and bus transportation are i
 ncluded in the ticket price. Students will be able to purchase food and a
 dditional haunted experiences like an escape room on site. The bus will d
 epart from the Student Recreation Center at 7:30 pm. Come ready for a cre
 epy\, thrilling Halloween night filled with scares\, fun\, and unforgetta
 ble memories. Don’t get ghosted on the trip!\n \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nReg
 ister on Fusion.\n$45 for students with a valid Montclair State ID\n\nWhe
 re and When?\n\nFriday\, October 9\, 2026\n8:00 p.m. - 10:30 p.m. (Bus le
 aves at 7:30 p.m.)\nTransportation will be provided and will start from t
 he Student Recreation Center.  Brighton Asylum Haunted House Tour is at 2
  Brighton Ave\, Passaic\, NJ 07055\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nA
 dditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/e
 ngage/event/12737878
