DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking about applying to law school? If so\, join us
  for our 44th Annual NJ Law School Day at Montclair State University! All
  NJ college students and alumni who are interested in applying to law sch
 ool are welcome to attend.\nAt NJ Law School Day\, you can speak with law
  school representatives from NJ\, NY\, and across the U.S. about what the
 ir programs have to offer and how you can prepare to be a strong law scho
 ol candidate.\n \nEvent Details: \n\nWednesday\, October 14\, 2026\nLocat
 ion: Montclair State University\, University Hall\, 7th Floor Conference 
 Center\nAll students and alumni are welcome to attend!\n1pm-2pm: Law Scho
 ol Panel Discussion --\n\nFor this session\, you will hear from law schoo
 l representatives about what they look for when reviewing applications an
 d how candidates can best represent themselves.\n\n\n\n2pm-4pm: The Law S
 chool Fair --\n\nThis is your chance to meet face-to- face with law schoo
 l professionals from NJ\, NY\, PA\, MA and many more law schools across t
 he U.S. and ask questions about applying to law school!\n\n\nBe prepared 
 to share information about you\, your interests\, and goals!\nDress to im
 press!  Business attire recommended.\n\nQuestions? Email Chrysten Colacic
 co\, Pre-Law Program Coordinator at MSU\, at prelaw@montclair.edu\n\nHost
