DESCRIPTION:Let’s walk and roll this fall! Join the Department of Kinesiol
 ogy\, the Exercise Science Student Organization\, and Athletics & Recreat
 ion as we take part in the Exercise is Medicine - On Campus walking chall
 enge. Our goal is to accumulate as many miles as we can during these 8 ho
 urs by encouraging physical activity in a friendly competition against ot
 her universities. Guided campus walks will begin every half hour from the
  Student Recreation Center front lawn to help you easily earn miles\, con
 nect with other students\, and take in the fall campus scenery. Stop by t
 he table to sign in\, hang out and play some lawn games from Intramural S
 ports\, grab a drink and a snack\, and earn those miles! The highest reco
 rded miles will win a free pair of Adidas shoes\, plus every mile earns y
 ou a raffle ticket for even more prizes including Adidas shoes\, smart wa
 tches\, headphones\, running/walking accessories\, and more! Can’t make i
 t to our table? No problem! You can track your steps/miles using your pho
 ne and submit them virtually and earn bonus miles by changing up your cam
 pus commute routine by visiting the following link and logging your steps
 : https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScnl5q0PKYQDVTEZp67DCAD4974cJc
 FB07IWkNMnkCc-CEvSA/viewform?usp=dialog\nWhere and when?\n\nWednesday\, O
 ctober 14th\n10 AM - 6 PM\nSRC Front Lawn\nWalks departing from SRC front
  lawn every half hour\, but also virtually (take your own walk and submit
  your miles or take healthy action steps for more miles)\nRain location o
 n SRC Track\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\, Exercise Science Student 
 Organization\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair
 .campuslabs.com/engage/event/12814128
