DESCRIPTION:In Polaroid Stories (play) by Naomi Iizuka\, young people gath
 er in an abandoned mansion where myth and the present collide\, revealing
  cycles of power\, loss\, and survival.\nDirector Statement:Set in a deca
 ying mansion once built to project authority\, this production focuses on
  those living at the margins and the systems that shape their lives.\n\nM
