DESCRIPTION:Join the Cussies for Bloom Bar\, a meaningful evening focused 
 on self-love\, finding your voice\, and raising awareness about domestic 
 violence. Together\, we'll create a safe and supportive space for reflect
 ion\, open conversation\, and empowerment while reminding one another of 
 the importance of healing\, advocacy\, and community. During the event\, 
 each attendee will create a personalized bouquet of three roses\, with ea
 ch rose symbolizing a powerful reminder to carry with them: love\, streng
 th\, and resilience. We hope you'll leave with not only a beautiful bouqu
 et\, but also a meaningful reminder of your value\, your strength\, and y
 our ability to continue blooming. \n\nHosted by: Chi Upsilon Sigma Nation
 al Latin Sorority\, INC\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https:
